<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">This pull request clarifies that Array.prototype.map() does not mutate the original array and instead returns a new array.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">This clarification helps avoid confusion for readers who may assume that map() modifies the existing array, especially beginners learning JavaScript array methods.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<p dir="auto">No functional changes were made. This is a documentation-only improvement.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>



]]></content>
